#. i18n: C:/Users/mf/Documents/XTrackCAD/src/v5_3_0_beta1/app/lib/demos/dmdelund.xtr:33
#: ../../../../build/v_5_3_0_beta1/app/i18n/custmsg.h:373
msgid ""
"Pressing the <Delete> button lets you delete selected tracks from the "
